# Backend Dockerization Chore

This commit adds Docker containerization for the Express backend:
- Created backend/Dockerfile with multi-stage build
  - Builder stage: Full dependencies for build
  - Production stage: Only runtime dependencies (optimized)
- Added backend/.dockerignore for build context optimization
- Configured health check: /api/demo endpoint every 30s
- Exposed port 3000 for API access

Features:
- Base image: node:20-alpine (lightweight)
- Multi-stage build reduces final image size
- Health checks for container orchestration
- Volume mount ready at /app/logs for logging persistence

Files created:
- backend/Dockerfile (containerization config)
- backend/.dockerignore (build optimization)
